    "How denote-sequence numbers notes: numeric (1=1=2), alphanumeric (1a2) or alphanumeric-delimited (1=a2).": {
      "comment": "Help for a config.toml setting",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie denote-sequence Notizen nummeriert: numeric (1=1=2), alphanumeric (1a2) oder alphanumeric-delimited (1=a2)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cómo numera denote-sequence las notas: numeric (1=1=2), alphanumeric (1a2) o alphanumeric-delimited (1=a2)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment denote-sequence numérote les notes : numeric (1=1=2), alphanumeric (1a2) ou alphanumeric-delimited (1=a2)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "denote-sequenceのメモの番号付け：numeric（1=1=2）、alphanumeric（1a2）またはalphanumeric-delimited（1=a2）。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Como denote-sequence numera as notas: numeric (1=1=2), alphanumeric (1a2) ou alphanumeric-delimited (1=a2)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How lines within a day are ordered: sort keys separated by spaces, each used when the ones before it tie, such as time-up, priority-down, category-keep, alpha-up, effort-up, tag-up and todo-state-up. Unknown keys are ignored. A view in views.toml can set its own with sorting-strategy.": {
      "comment": "Help for a config.toml setting",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie die Zeilen innerhalb eines Tages sortiert werden: Sortierschlüssel, getrennt durch Leerzeichen, jeder genutzt, wenn die vorherigen gleich sind, etwa time-up, priority-down, category-keep, alpha-up, effort-up, tag-up und todo-state-up. Unbekannte Schlüssel werden ignoriert. Eine Ansicht in views.toml kann mit sorting-strategy eine eigene festlegen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cómo se ordenan las líneas dentro de un día: claves de ordenación separadas por espacios, cada una usada cuando las anteriores empatan, como time-up, priority-down, category-keep, alpha-up, effort-up, tag-up y todo-state-up. Las claves desconocidas se ignoran. Una vista de views.toml puede definir el suyo con sorting-strategy."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment les lignes d'un jour sont triées : clés de tri séparées par des espaces, chacune utilisée quand les précédentes sont à égalité, comme time-up, priority-down, category-keep, alpha-up, effort-up, tag-up et todo-state-up. Les clés inconnues sont ignorées. Une vue dans views.toml peut définir son propre ordre avec sorting-strategy."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1日の中の行の並び順：スペース区切りの並べ替えキーで、前のキーが同じ場合に次のキーを使用します（time-up、priority-down、category-keep、alpha-up、effort-up、tag-up、todo-state-upなど）。不明なキーは無視されます。views.tomlのビューはsorting-strategyで独自に設定できます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Como as linhas de um dia são ordenadas: chaves de ordenação separadas por espaços, cada uma usada quando as anteriores empatam, como time-up, priority-down, category-keep, alpha-up, effort-up, tag-up e todo-state-up. Chaves desconhecidas são ignoradas. Uma visualização em views.toml pode definir a própria com sorting-strategy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many flashcards are due for review.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
