    "The iPhone buttons show where the editor is narrow, the iPad buttons where it is wide.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die iPhone-Tasten erscheinen, wo der Editor schmal ist, die iPad-Tasten, wo er breit ist."
