    "What a SCHEDULED date makes in iCalendar export, separated by spaces: event-if-not-todo, event-if-todo, event-if-todo-not-done and todo-start.": {
      "comment": "Help for a config.toml setting",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was ein SCHEDULED-Datum im iCalendar-Export erzeugt, getrennt durch Leerzeichen: event-if-not-todo, event-if-todo, event-if-todo-not-done und todo-start."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué genera una fecha SCHEDULED en la exportación a iCalendar, separado por espacios: event-if-not-todo, event-if-todo, event-if-todo-not-done y todo-start."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que produit une date SCHEDULED dans l'export iCalendar, séparé par des espaces : event-if-not-todo, event-if-todo, event-if-todo-not-done et todo-start."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCalendar書き出しでSCHEDULEDの日付から作るもの、スペース区切り：event-if-not-todo、event-if-todo、event-if-todo-not-done、todo-start。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O que uma data SCHEDULED gera na exportação para iCalendar, separado por espaços: event-if-not-todo, event-if-todo, event-if-todo-not-done e todo-start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What marking an entry done records: nil records nothing, time adds a CLOSED timestamp, note adds the timestamp and asks for a note.": {
      "comment": "Help for a config.toml setting",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was das Erledigen eines Eintrags festhält: nil hält nichts fest, time fügt einen CLOSED-Zeitstempel hinzu, note fügt den Zeitstempel hinzu und fragt nach einer Notiz."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué registra completar una entrada: nil no registra nada, time añade una marca de tiempo CLOSED, note añade la marca de tiempo y pide una nota."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qu'enregistre le fait de marquer une entrée terminée : nil n'enregistre rien, time ajoute un horodatage CLOSED, note ajoute l'horodatage et demande une note."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エントリを完了にしたときに記録するもの：nilは何も記録せず、timeはCLOSEDタイムスタンプを追加し、noteはタイムスタンプを追加してメモを求めます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O que concluir uma entrada registra: nil não registra nada, time adiciona um carimbo de data CLOSED, note adiciona o carimbo e pede uma nota."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the agenda shows": {
